  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Incoming Mission MIRADER MIRAH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The high level delegation visit to the Netherlands from the Ivorian Ministry of State, Ministry of Agriculture, Rural Development and Food Crop Production (Minist&#xe8;re de l&#x2019;Agriculture, du D&#xe9;veloppement Rural et des Productions Vivri&#xe8;res &#x2013; MEMINADERPV) and the Ministry of Animal and Fisheries Resources (Minist&#xe8;re des Ressources Animales et Halieutiques &#x2013; MIRAH) is expected to contribute to the strengthening of the bilateral agricultural cooperation, to facilitate access for Dutch businesses and knowledge institutes in horticulture, cocoa and poultry and to position the Netherlands as a preferred partner in the agri-food industry. The visit will allow for promotion of Dutch participation in the SARA 2025, the largest agrifood &#x2018;salon&#x2019; of West-Africa, that takes place from 23 May to 1 June.</narrative>
  </description>
